							<div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-32 h-32 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#2563EB]/8 to-transparent rounded-full blur-2xl -ml-16 -mt-16"></div>
							<div class="relative z-10">
								<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-3 mb-4">
									<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
										<span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.15em] border border-[#2563EB]/40 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#2563EB]/15 to-[#2563EB]/5 text-[#1D4ED8] dark:from-blue-500/20 dark:to-blue-500/5 dark:text-blue-300 shadow-sm">◆ Proyecto</span>
										<span class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-gray-500 dark:text-slate-400">Ene - Feb 2025</span>
									</div>
									<span class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-light text-gray-300 dark:text-slate-600">02</span>
								</div>
								<h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-slate-50 mb-1 tracking-tight">Desarrollo Web Freelance</h3>
								<p class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#2563EB] mb-2 uppercase tracking-wider">Independiente</p>
								<p class="text-sm md:text-[15px] text-gray-700 dark:text-slate-300/95 leading-relaxed mb-4">Diseño y desarrollo de landing pages, sistemas web personalizados con optimización SEO técnico, experiencia de usuario intuitiva y rendimiento premium.</p>
								<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
									<span class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 bg-gray-200/60 dark:bg-slate-700/60 border border-gray-300/40 dark:border-slate-600/40 backdrop-blur-sm">Frontend</span>
									<span class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 bg-gray-200/60 dark:bg-slate-700/60 border border-gray-300/40 dark:border-slate-600/40 backdrop-blur-sm">UX Design</span>
									<span class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 bg-gray-200/60 dark:bg-slate-700/60 border border-gray-300/40 dark:border-slate-600/40 backdrop-blur-sm">SEO</span>
