								<p class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#0EA5E9] mb-2 uppercase tracking-wider">INACAP Santiago Centro</p>
								<p class="text-sm md:text-[15px] text-gray-700 dark:text-slate-300/95 leading-relaxed mb-4">Formación integral en ciencias de la computación: arquitectura de software, bases de datos avanzadas, algoritmos complejos y metodologías de desarrollo profesional.</p>
								<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
									<span class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 bg-gray-200/60 dark:bg-slate-700/60 border border-gray-300/40 dark:border-slate-600/40 backdrop-blur-sm">Computación</span>
									<span class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 bg-gray-200/60 dark:bg-slate-700/60 border border-gray-300/40 dark:border-slate-600/40 backdrop-blur-sm">Algoritmos</span>
									<span class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 bg-gray-200/60 dark:bg-slate-700/60 border border-gray-300/40 dark:border-slate-600/40 backdrop-blur-sm">Arquitectura</span>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</article>
				</div>
			</div>
		</SectionContainer>

